**Security practices:**
- Validate all input before processing
- Use parameterized queries (e.g., `?param=value?`) instead of manual concatenation
- Don't trust the HTTP request line — parse it
- Never trust the client-side validation alone
- Consider redirects or rate limiting if parameter abuse is detected

